# golden is committed on purpose: since 2026-08-25 it is the only surviving
# record of the deleted Python original's HTTP surface, nothing regenerates
# it, and a clone of this repo needs it for parity/gate-has-teeth.sh to run
# at all. The rest (go-1, py-*) are scratch captures from the porting process
# and stay ignored.
parity/captures/*
!parity/captures/golden/
*.db
*.duckdb
bin/
passports/
events/
local/
cover.out

# A local Claude Code preview config: absolute paths into a session scratchpad,
# useful to whoever generated it and to nobody else. It reached main in #48 by a
# git add -A that swept an untracked directory the tooling had just created.
.claude/
